<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Energen downgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Energen downgraded to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Edward Jones analyst Subash Chandra said he downgraded Energen Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>--Shares in the natural gas company were off 3/8 to 30-7/8.</p>
<p>--Chandra said he made the move based on valuation.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
